mpechoat $b [1;35m╠╬○╬◆╬○╬╣[31m█[41m︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴︴[40m█[35m╠╬○╬◆╬○╬╣[0m
mpechoat $b [1;32m╠╬◆╬●╬◆╬╣[31m█[36;41m═══[37m §[32m魂飛九天[37m §[36m═══[31;40m█[32m╠╬◆╬●╬◆╬╣[0m
